  "title": "A page control label's Alignment Left / Centered / Right is PSPNLFIELD.DSPLFORMAT 0x80000 / 0x100000 / 0x200000",
  "statement": "Label alignment is stored as exactly one of DSPLFORMAT 0x80000 (Left), 0x100000 (Centered) and 0x200000 (Right); choosing another replaces the bit and keeps the rest of DSPLFORMAT. Observed on check boxes, group boxes, an edit box and a long edit box. A static text's own alignment is stored differently (0x1 / 0x2 / 0x4).",
